  "facts": {
    "alliance": "isAlliedTo accepts self, then native super alliance, then recipient EntityType in cataclysm:team_ignis only if both teams null. AreaAttack and spin additionally exclude every Ignited_Berserker instance, even when team predicates alone would differ. Uncalled AreaSwordAttack has no explicit same-class exclusion. Body repel ignores alliance. No owner promotion, shared recipient list or universal team immunity inferred.",
    "area_brand": "Only true AreaAttack hurt raw-stacks existing Blazing Brand: absent0, otherwise oldAmp+1 after removeEffectNoUpdate, clamp0..1; add new effect100ticks with ambientfalse/visibletrue/icontrue and default null source. Preserve locked armor/toughness status behavior, native admission/immunity/stacking/lifecycle; no Brand DOT/burn invented. AddEffect boolean is ignored. Amplifier/cap are native stack state, not a surrogate scalar for damage/healing.",
    "area_damage": "Server AreaAttack excludes allies/self/all Berserker instances then requests mobAttack(this),f32(current ATTACK_DAMAGE*double(call.damage_multiplier)). State1 calls multiplier1.25; states5/6 use1; installed base7.5 is locked setup, not a fixed request. Native hurt/armor/cooldown/defenses/cancellation remain. Hurt boolean gates Brand and self-heal separately; shield-disable branch is independent. No forced victim movement, projectile, ignite, hurt-time reset or extra hit is added by this helper.",
    "area_geometry": "aiStep states1/5/6 call AreaAttack at the ten exact recorded attackTicks; each passes width*range multiplier, equal height multiplier, arc, damage multiplier and shield ticks. No caller requires a current target or checks local side; helper queries nearby before its server guard. Locked nearby query and atan2-90 versus yBodyRot angle/3D-distance predicates remain. The main arc branch checks horizontal distance<=range; wrap-angle OR branches do not repeat that check, though the nearby helper still limits the query. Same-class/ally/self exclusions remain. Geometry/tick/source payloads are separate; call tuples are context, not one inferred attack formula.",
    "area_heal": "Following successful AreaAttack hurt and the Brand application attempt, call self.heal(2f*(i+1)), where same native clamped i is0/1 (raw requests2/4). It occurs per admitted victim; effect refusal does not suppress heal. Existing native heal event, cancellation and max-health bounds remain; true hurt does not prove final HP loss. Heal is independent from outgoing damage and the Brand attribute status, not life steal based on actual lost HP.",
    "attack_selection": "Priority1 goals $1/$2/$3/$4 use locked InternalAttackGoal: current target exists/alive, strict distance<3.6f/4.5/4.5/8 and raw state0. Then short-circuit RNG nextFloat()*100<12/16/16/12; $2/$3 additionally sword_dance_cooldown<=0, $4 spin_cooldown<=0. RNG is consumed before the local cooldown check. No additional HP/shield/phase/altar/Stage/LOS test in these canUse overrides. Native selector ordering/flags remain authoritative; these percentages are not one summed proc probability.",
    "body_repulsion": "Every root tick after cooldown decrement calls locked repelEntities(width*0.75f,height,width*0.75f,width*0.75f). Locked nearby query retains self exclusion, bbox/3D-distance+recipient-half-width and upper-Y predicates. Pickable !noPhysics recipients get absolute horizontal coefficient-0.1*cos/sin(angle), retaining old Y. No native knockback/push/resistance read or damage/ally/current-target/hurt/NoAI/local-side guard. Unlike the previous Revenant uncalled helper, this root has a direct caller. Native collision admission of the recipient is separate.",
    "combo_self_lunge": "State5 at attackTicks11/18/23/28 and state6 at15/123/26/33 calls self.push(cos(yaw+90)*0.45,0,sin(yaw+90)*0.45). Preserve the literal123, even though ordinary state6 goal max is55; do not silently change it to23. This is additive self horizontal motion using entity yaw, distinct from yBodyRot arc targeting and victim push/knockback. No hurt/target/ground/local-side gate; Y increment0 does not clear existing Y. No upward launch is reached.",
    "defeat_lifecycle": "R2k13a concrete die invokes locked Animation_Monsters death admission then unconditionally resets raw state0 after normal void return (also after native cancellation); duration20 retained. Root metadata declares no onDeathAIUpdate/AfterDefeatBoss/tickDeath/respawner override. Existing IA-monster/Animation_Monsters native cancellation, source credit, death/update/removal contract remains. No concrete death attack, respawner construction or Ignis-world-flag mutation is reached. Protected instance spawn/placement is not reinterpreted as a universal all-creation gate; global callbacks are not claimed absent.",
    "falling_motion": "After super.tick, when !onGround && old velocityY<0, write old velocity multiplied(1,0.6,1). Preserve X/Z; no target/state/hurt or local side gate. This is direct self velocity damping, not Slow Falling or blanket fall/drowning immunity. Locked environment admission remains unchanged.",
    "payload_terrain_closure": "Root tick/aiStep and five goals reach direct native area hurt, status/heal/shield APIs and movement only; no owned projectile/attack-entity construction, explosion, terrain mutation, damaging debris, victim mount/grab or summoned attack payload. Reuse native navigation/environment callbacks without claiming global hooks absent. Raw state is not a projectile lifecycle or delayed receipt. Registered type/placement/instance Ignis flag remain R2k13a; no offense world-flag write/home/encounter mutation reached.",
    "pursuit_goal": "Priority2 InternalMoveGoal(this,false,1) reuses native living-target/navigation/look contract, including path-done continuation for false, repath delay and FOLLOW_RANGE handling. It never calls hurt/doHurtTarget; registerGoals has no MeleeAttackGoal. Spin3 state goal has empty flags, so it does not itself reserve MOVE/LOOK/JUMP; do not invent a stationary or exclusive-movement gate. Target priority1 native HurtByTargetGoal and priority2 NearestAttackableTargetGoal(Player,true) remain native. Utility look/wander goals are not combat payloads.",
    "sequence_state": "Bindings are recorded separately: 0->1->0 max50/look15; 0->5->0 max50/look50; 0->6->0 max55/look55; 0->2->3 max30/look25; 3->3->4 max90/look0; 4->4->0 max40/look0. Shared attack goal start resets raw state/ticks and stops navigation; continue uses matching state and attackTicks<=max; stop sets end state then native target/aggro/navigation cleanup. Shared state start skips setter when required==active, so spin3 and recovery4 start do not reset ticks again. Spin boolean constructor(false) sets no MOVE/LOOK/JUMP flags; shared tick handles native facing, not a velocity write. Combo $2/$3 stop first call super then write shared sword cooldown40; recovery $5 stop first super then spin cooldown80, including an interrupted stop. Root tick calls super, then decrements positive cooldowns once. Raw setters/NBT/death reset remain R2k13a; state/timing/cooldown values are not automatic Stage scalars.",
    "shield_disable": "After AreaAttack hurt, independently of its boolean, recheck victim.isDamageSourceBlocked(the same mobAttack source); require Player and supplied shieldbreakticks>0. Only state1/tick17 supplies60; other calls supply0. Locked EntityUtil.disableShield rechecks server+isBlocking, adds cooldown to the actual active use-item type, stops use and broadcasts event30. Preserve native directional/blocking/cooldown gates and exact current item; no generic shield tag assumption.",
    "spin_aura_damage": "Raw state3 && global tickCount%4==0 && server queries LivingEntity in self.bbox.inflate(1). Exclude allies/all Berserkers/self; request mobAttack(this),f32(current ATTACK_DAMAGE). No current-target/LOS/arc/positive-HP-loss test or explicit extra3D radius filter. Native hurt result gates only separate push. It does not apply Brand, heal, ignite or reset hurt time; global tickCount cadence is not attackTicks-relative.",
    "spin_push": "After true spin mobAttack hurt, dx/dz=victim-self; d=max(dx*dx+dz*dz,0.001); victim.push(dx/d*0.5,0.1,dz/d*0.5). This is additive inverse-square horizontal motion plus Y increment, not a normalized vector or native knockback. No recipient knockback-resistance read, absolute velocity replacement, second damage/effect or independent target selection. Preserve native denominator floor and hurt gate.",
    "sword_helper_brand": "Uncalled AreaSwordAttack helper, only if its native sword_dance hurt returns true: same existing raw Brand stack/removal/clamp0..1, normal addEffect120ticks, false/true/true and null source. AddEffect return ignored; no fire or DOT. This retains locked R2k2e helper semantics without inventing an active delivery or scalar amplifier/cap.",
    "sword_helper_damage": "Private AreaSwordAttack exists but exact caller scan of root+five registered goals finds no invocation; active spin/combo paths do not call it. If called, locked nearby and atan2-degree/yBodyRot range/arc-wrap admission exclude allies/self (no explicit same-Berserker-type test), then request causeSwordDanceDamage(this),f32(current ATTACK_DAMAGE*double(supplied damage)). Source is cataclysm:sword_dance, direct/causing Berserker; bundled definition exhaustion0.1, native difficulty scaling when_caused_by_living_non_player, tag bypasses_cooldown. Preserve native defenses/hooks, not an all-defense bypass. No local server guard or received call argument values proven. Observed inactive helper is not promoted to an active Stage parameter.",
    "sword_helper_heal": "Uncalled AreaSwordAttack helper would call self.heal(float(3*(native clamped i+1))) after true sword_dance hurt and Brand attempt; i0/1 gives3/6. It is not the active AreaAttack heal2/4, not derived from victim HP loss, and does not require effect acceptance. Native healing/max-health/cancellation remain. No active caller or future Stage parameter invented."
  },
